<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Sydney</p>
<p>International tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, first round</p>
<p>Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-1 6-0</p>
<p>Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S. beat 8-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-1 3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Rachel McQuillan (Australia) beat 7-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-4 6-7 (0-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 6-3 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat 1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Women's singles, second round</p>
<p>3-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Sarah Pitkowski (France) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Mary Pierce (France) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Men's singles, first round</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Sargis Sargisian (Armenia) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia)</p>
<p>2-6 6-3 7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 3-6 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat 4-Jan Siemerink (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-4 2-6 6-1</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Neville Godwin (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 5-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>8-Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia)</p>
<p>6-2 7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) beat 7-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6) 6-3</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat 6-Marc Rosset (Switzerland)</p>
<p>6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 2-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 2-6</p>
<p>6-0 6-3</p>
</text>
